=2 Walkthrough
* Go to {z:Gusgen Mines} or {z:Palborough Mines} or {z:Ifrit's Cauldron} and mine for the {@k} {k:sturdy metal strip|Sturdy metal strip}.
* Go to {z:East Ronfaure} or {z:Jugner Forest} or {z:Ghelsba Outpost} or {z:Yuhtunga Jungle} and log for the {@k} {k:piece of rugged tree bark|Piece of rugged tree bark}.
* Go to {z:Giddeus} or {z:West Sarutabaruta} and harvest the {@k} {k:savory lamb roast|Savory lamb roast}.
* After you have all three {@k} key items, examine the Inconspicuous Door in Upper Jeuno (at (H-8), across from Durable Shields) three times for three cutscenes.
** You do not need to collect all three before the cutscenes. Each item triggers one cutscene. This method is just more efficient.

>**{c=red:Note}**:
* These {@k} key items can be obtained in any order, even before the moogle even asks for them.
* For maximum efficiency, be sure that **your inventory is full** before attempting to gather at a node, allowing repeated attempts to obtain the {@k} key item.
** The node will persist even if the gathered item can't be received, saving you the hassle of chasing new nodes to receive the {@k} key item.
** Obtaining the {@k} key item is truly random, and has taken 50+ attempts for unlucky characters. Tool breaks are uncommon but can happen. Bring at least 1 stack of each tool to avoid having to run back to town.

=2 "A Moogle Kupo d'Etat" Key
* Re-obtain another {@k} {k:sturdy metal strip|Sturdy metal strip}, {@k} {k:piece of rugged tree bark|Piece of rugged tree bark}, and {@k} {k:savory lamb roast|Savory lamb roast}.
* Head to {z:Port Jeuno} and ask {n:Squintrox Dryeyes} (G-8) for a {@k} {k:Blue coral key} to make the exchange.
** The key can be received once per day.
* Use the {@k} {k:Blue coral key} (Level 40) to open the red treasure coffer at {z:Lower Jeuno} (J-8).
** Rewards are listed on the {p:Add-on Scenario Rewards} page.

